    "detailed_description": "<h1>Multiplayer</h1><p><strong>The multiplayer mode is in alpha &amp; was just released on 26.06.2020</strong></p><br><h1>KICKSTARTER</h1><p>Be part of the mysterious laboratory &amp; support me on<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/58eb4315b3c6d0b9850d990ecafb06f4.webp?t=1596376167\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.webm?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.mp4?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Note: Multiplayer mode is in alpha &amp; was just released on 26.06.2020</strong><br><br>In LAB 7: Cold Nights - wise foresight decides on the outcome of your fate. Wasted coins, reckless use of electricity, and poor time management will lead to your demise. Explore your surroundings, build defenses and fight your way to freedom.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/bdbef48249c87470c3ec522942a0f924.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/bdbef48249c87470c3ec522942a0f924.apng?t=1596376167\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An <strong>action</strong> packed <strong>strategy &amp; resource management</strong> game featuring minimalist <strong>adventure elements</strong> in a <strong>2D sidescroller</strong> world.<br></li><li> Find a path to freedom as you defend yourself with defenses, weapons, and chemicals against defiant victims of the lab.<br></li><li> Grind your way through the lab while leveling up your guns. <br></li><li> Compete in speed runs against other players and rank in a global Steam leaderboard shown in game.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/764734aecdd6614e8c662a5483c87982.avif?t=1596376167\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.webm?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.mp4?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.webm?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/b1c771953ff406fd669641be065faf36.mp4?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Note: Multiplayer mode is in alpha &amp; was just released on 26.06.2020</strong><br><br>In LAB 7: Cold Nights - wise foresight decides on the outcome of your fate. Wasted coins, reckless use of electricity, and poor time management will lead to your demise. Explore your surroundings, build defenses and fight your way to freedom.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/bdbef48249c87470c3ec522942a0f924.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/bdbef48249c87470c3ec522942a0f924.apng?t=1596376167\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An <strong>action</strong> packed <strong>strategy &amp; resource management</strong> game featuring minimalist <strong>adventure elements</strong> in a <strong>2D sidescroller</strong> world.<br></li><li> Find a path to freedom as you defend yourself with defenses, weapons, and chemicals against defiant victims of the lab.<br></li><li> Grind your way through the lab while leveling up your guns. <br></li><li> Compete in speed runs against other players and rank in a global Steam leaderboard shown in game.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/764734aecdd6614e8c662a5483c87982.avif?t=1596376167\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.poster.avif?t=1596376167\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.webm?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173310/extras/d4e4799e53ae65365c9cef491e3999b9.mp4?t=1596376167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
